OL,3,AUK inflation rate rises to 3.5% after
OL,4,Afuel prices surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FInflation increased to 3.5% in the year
OL,7,Fto September, new figures show, driven
OL,8,Fby rising fuel prices
OL,10,FThe rising cost of airfares also
OL,11,Fcontributed to the uptick, and to a
OL,12,Flesser extent, the cost of going to
OL,13,Flive events
OL,15,FIt comes ahead of the Budget next week,
OL,16,Fthe first since Andy Burnham became
OL,17,Fprime minister
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
