OL,3,AUK inflation rate rises to 3.5% after
OL,4,Afuel prices surge
OL,5,
OL,6,FInflation rose to 3.1% in August, its
OL,7,Fhighest level in five months - today's
OL,8,Ffigures from the Office for National
OL,9,FStatistics (ONS) cover the 12 months to
OL,10,FSeptember
OL,12,FInflation measures the increase in the
OL,13,Fprice of something over time - the Bank
OL,14,Fof England has a target of keeping the
OL,15,Frate at 2%
